  "measurement_scope": [
    "Eight native Ngspice-dialect OP/NPN cases: both phase operators, 1/16 private-resistance devices, with/without three scheduled checkpoints. Complete decks/configuration remain in the hashed reports.",
    "Two independent launches, each with one warmup and five measured full runs and cancellations per case. Waveform bits, accepted/poll counts and minimum successful transport quotas match across launches.",
    "Cancellation requested at the first accepted point at/after half the 4.096ns horizon, after more than one transport delay. Public return includes cleanup; no further sample accepted.",
    "The quota probe measures charged transport-record capacity/copies only. It verifies success at the exact limit and refusal one byte below, and repeats before/after timing. Zero for Weil does not mean zero memory use.",
    "The 5000ms median-run, 100ms maximum cancellation and 8MiB charged-storage gates were declared before the measurements. They are provisional gates for these workloads, not universal product limits.",
    "16 GP integration tests pass on Windows/MSVC with/without core default features in both dev/test and release profiles. The browser-feature target is compile-checked only, not executed."
  ],
